            <ArticleTitle>Update on chronic pain management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>456-62; quiz 462-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic pain remains a significant health problem in the United States. Old treatments are being modified, and new treatment options are being developed based on outcome studies. This article addresses some of the new concepts in conservative and invasive treatment options that are supported by outcome studies for the treatment of chronic pain patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
